 "title": "Grain | Meet the Team - Key Cooperative",
 "text": "Grain | Meet the Team - Key Cooperative\nMain\nUtilities\nAbout\nWho We Are\nOur Leaders\nValue Of A Co-Op\nCommunity Involvement\nHistory Timeline\nCustomer Resources\nAgronomy\nSeed\nAgronomy Services\nCrop Nutrition\nCrop Protection\nCENTROL Precision Ag\nConservation\nAgronomy Team\nGrain\nCash Bids Futures\nCash Bids Sign Up\nCrop Insurance\nDiscount Schedules & Policies\nGrain Marketing Options\nGrain Team\nEnergy\nPropane\nRefined Fuels\nAutomated Fuel Delivery\nLube, Oil & Grease\n24 Hour Fuel Stations\nMember Discount\nEnergy Team\nFeed\nBeef\nDairy\nEquine\nPet Food\nPoultry\nSheep & Goat\nShow Feeds\nSwine\nPrograms\nFeed Team\nRetail\nLumber & Construction\nEnergy & Retail Center\nContact Us\nCareers\nNews\nCustomer Account\nContact Us\nCareers\nNews\nCustomer Account\nKey Cooperative Grain Team\nGrain Team\nAt Key Cooperative, our grain team has one primary goal: to help maximize the value of every bushel you sell. We offer competitive local grain bids, flexible grain contracts and expert marketing advice to help you make informed decisions that boost profitability. Our locations feature modern grain elevators and storage facilities with rail access in both Newton and Nevada.\nOur team understands that your grain operation is the backbone of your farm and its success is vital. From crop commodity insights to risk management strategies, we partner with you to navigate market changes and protect your bottom line. We also offer crop insurance options to safeguard your investment and provide peace of mind throughout the growing season. Key's grain team is committed to providing the resources and expert recommendations you need to succeed. Contact us today to optimize your marketing plan!\nClick photo for more information\nJarod Lemper\nGrain Division Manager\nGreg Artz\nField Marketing Specialist, Licensed Crop Insurance Agent\nLinda Kuhl\nGrain Marketing and Origination Specialist\nZack Gardner\nGrain Marketing and Origination Specialist\nKolby Winter\nGrain Originator\nColton Voga\nGrain Merchandiser\nPaul Larson\nLead Dispatcher\nMorgan Goodmanson\nGrain Accountant Lead\nNikki Russell\nGrain Accountant\nAmy Gathman\nGrain Accountant\nRisk Management Team\nClick photo for more information\nGreg Artz\nField Marketing Specialist, Licensed Crop Insurance Agent\nLinda Kuhl\nGrain Marketing and Origination Specialist\nZack Gardner\nGrain Marketing and Origination Specialist\nKolby Winter\nGrain Originator\nGrain Locations\nGrain\nBarnes City\n525 Vine Street\nBarnes City, IA 50027\n641-644-5122\nDirections\nGilbert\n228 Main Street\nGilbert, IA 50105\n515-232-6515\nDirections\nGrinnell Elevator\n330 West Street S\nGrinnell, IA 50112\n641-236-6591\nDirections\nGrinnell Feed Mill\n1006 Industrial Avenue\nGrinnell, IA 50112\n641-236-6565\nDirections\nKelley\n27948 530th Avenue\nKelley, IA 50134\n515-769-2244\nDirections\nLeGrand\n1004 County Highway E49\nMarshalltown, IA 50158\n641-479-2800\nDirections\nNevada\n22703 600th Avenue\nNevada, IA 50201\n515-382-5461\nDirections\nNew Sharon\n1380 Highway 63\nNew Sharon, IA 50207\n641-637-4097\nDirections\nNewton\n1669 Highway 14 N\nNewton, IA 50208\n641-791-0740\nDirections\nNewton Rail Center\n3300 E 28th Street N\nNewton, IA 50208\n641-792-1940\nDirections\nS14/Roland\n13585 620th Avenue\nRoland, IA 50236\n515-388-4341\nDirections\nSt. Anthony\n102 W 3rd Street\nSt. Anthony, IA 50239\n641-477-8244\nDirections\nStory City\n633 Market Avenue\nStory City, IA 50248\n515-733-4358\nDirections\nSully\n504 6th Avenue\nSully, IA 50251\n641-594-4115\nDirections\nZearing Grain Site\n71286 130th Street\nZearing, IA 50278\n641-487-7641\nDirections\nZearing\n102 S Center Street\nZearing, IA 50278\n641-487-7641\nDirections\n+ −\nLeaflet | © OpenStreetMap contributors\nABOUT\nAGRONOMY\nGRAIN\nENERGY\nFEED\nRETAIL\nCONTACT US\nCAREERS\nNEWS\nCUSTOMER ACCOUNT\nSTAFF ONLY\nPrivacy & Terms of Service\n|\nSite Map\n© 2026 Key Cooperative - All rights reserved\nSearch for:\nMinimum 3 chara